      "respecification_note": "G4 AS PRE-REGISTERED (\u00a77) FAILED and that is RECORDED, not quietly redefined (the nyiso-115 G2 / nyiso-117 G2a precedent). It demanded an exact $40.00 dual for every hour with shortfall in the CLOSED interval (0, band] \u2014 asymmetric, because it excluded the LOWER kink (`s > 0`) while including the UPPER one (`s == band`). At either kink the LP is degenerate and the dual is legitimately anywhere between the adjacent bands' prices; that is exactly why the zero-shortfall hours price at $7.75/$17.31 rather than $0, which the pre-registered form already tolerated. Re-specified onto what K-G actually asks \u2014 the STRICT interior must price at the published increment, and the band edge must be BRACKETED by the two adjacent band prices. The mechanism is unchanged; only the gate's boundary handling is.",
